{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit","id":1511130,"title":"What is the procedure, for a Sorcerer, to learn Gifts from a totem spirit?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-09T08:17:56-07:00","id":1511130,"title":"What is the procedure, for a Sorcerer, to learn Gifts from a totem spirit?","content":"One merit from the book &quot;The Sorcerer&quot;, called Totem, allows a &quot;common&quot; mortal to learn spirit Gifts through a complex procedure including Chiminage ( services to do for the spirit ) and - although that is not explicitly said - presumably experience expenditure.<br /> <br /> So, what Paths of linear magic could be used to contact an appropriate totem spirit? Could it be simply be &quot;contacted&quot; ( like making a spiritual phone call ), it must be summoned in our reality, or the sorcerer has to travel into the spirit realm himself?<br /> <br /> About ranks, the sourcebook ( The Sorcerer ) says nothing about an upper limit for those gift's level. I guess only rank 1 are avaiable to mortals?<br /> <br /> - - -<br /> <br /> And more specifically, from the book Skinner: what gifts could be learned from the Minotaur? What services could he ask for bestowing his gifts upon a mortal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8595,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8595-conradine","user":"Conradine","date":". 05-09-2023, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8595-conradine","name":"Conradine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8595_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-09T08:22:34-07:00","id":1511131,"title":"","content":"With no Rage and no Gnosis, you're not going to have a very wide selection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-09T09:12:17-07:00","id":1511132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Conradine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit#post1511130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One merit from the book &quot;The Sorcerer&quot;, called Totem, allows a &quot;common&quot; mortal to learn spirit Gifts through a complex procedure including Chiminage ( services to do for the spirit )</div> </div> </div> </div> You enter a full pact, ie you gain the benefits as well as the duties. In case of Minotaur, you accept that you don't leave any follower of Pegasus you see alive or at least unhurt. That includes any Black Furies you come across.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Conradine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit#post1511130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what Paths of linear magic could be used to contact an appropriate totem spirit? Could it be simply be &quot;contacted&quot; ( like making a spiritual phone call ), it must be summoned in our reality, or the sorcerer has to travel into the spirit realm himself?</div> </div> </div> </div> The most common ones would be Ephemera, Summoning (rude), and maybe Spirit Chasing. These are not strictly required, as you can also contact Spirits through Rites- that is, if your chosen Totem deigns to contact <i>you</i> after asking. I can't remember on top of my head, but I think there's a very basic &quot;hello I'm here&quot; Minor Rite to get a spirit's attention. Performing Rites doesn't even require sorcery; just knowledge, execution, and goodwill of the Spirit.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Conradine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit#post1511130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About ranks, the sourcebook ( The Sorcerer ) says nothing about an upper limit for those gift's level. I guess only rank 1 are available to mortals?</div> </div> </div> </div> Yes, Level 1 Gifts only for mortals, at out-of-tribe XP costs. Your Totem usually doesn't teach them directly, but will have minor Spirits to do it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Conradine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit#post1511130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And more specifically, from the book Skinner: what gifts could be learned from the Minotaur? What services could he ask for bestowing his gifts upon a mortal?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's no fixed Gift list. Minotaur would probably favor Metis (he's the representation of the man-beast) and Ahroun Gifts, even some of the BSD lists. As <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a> mentioned, you can't learn Gifts that require Rage, Gnosis, or both. If you're playing a Sorcerer, your ST could allow you to use Quintessence instead of Gnosis, but that's not RAW.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Custom Sorcery: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1487084-pattern-weaving-ananasi-sorcery-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">For Ananasi</a> | Mortal:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1509365-hekau-for-sorcerers\" target=\"_blank\"> Hekau</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1550552-ma%C5%A1ma%C5%A1%C5%A1%C5%ABtu-mesopotamian-sorcery\" target=\"_blank\">Ma\u0161ma\u0161\u0161\u016btu</a> | Necromancy:<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1514352\" target=\"_blank\"> Dust Path</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1535508-dav20-older-lamia-lore?p=1536244#post1536244\" target=\"_blank\">P.o.Fertile Grave Soil</a> | Thauma: <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1513911-have-you-your-players-ever-used-disciplines-sorcery-for-scholarly-pursuits/page2#post1515316\" target=\"_blank\">Ars Notoria</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27477-voidshaper","name":"voidshaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27477_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-09T13:19:36-07:00","id":1511151,"title":"","content":"There is no official book titled &quot;The Sorcerer.&quot; It sounds like your using World of Darkness: Sorcerer (since Totem as a Merit was dropped in later editions). The idea of allowing Sorcerers with Totems to learn Gifts was dropped in later books. The only way in the current rules for a sorcerer (or any other Numina user) to learn Gifts is to also be a Kinfolk, and follow the rules for them for doing so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-15T14:47:33-07:00","id":1511737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Conradine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1511130-what-is-the-procedure-for-a-sorcerer-to-learn-gifts-from-a-totem-spirit#post1511130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, what Paths of linear magic could be used to contact an appropriate totem spirit? (...) </div> </div> </div> </div>I think that a single or an extended roll of attributes and / or abilities - selected to be appropriate and practical for the intent, goal, circumstances, and situation - could be used instead of a particular Path of Sorcery.<br /> There is the option that a spoken ( or written ) invocation or song could also work. Another possibility is the use of a magic or personal / special item . Relatively mundane, straightforward, normal, and practical methods can often just as well lead to distinct and good results.<br /> Family and friends of a Sorceress ( or a Sorcerer ) can also be considered and perhaps included in regard to these activities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}